      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Prompt Tips",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "version": "7.0.1",
          "widget_ue_connectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n① Write one emotion-dominant word\n(For example: relaxed, natural, confident, light pose)\n→ This lets the model understand \"people need emotions, not be stiff\"\n\n② Write one \"body state\"\n→ For example: slightly leaning forward, relaxed shoulders, natural smile\nThis makes the movements not stiff, not like a repeating machine\n\n③ Only give \"lighting + scene in one sentence\"\n→ For example: indoor natural light, hallway casual shot\nThis way the image feels like a real photo, not heavy AI flavor\nZ-Image will automatically give you that \"candid shot feel + micro-expression details\".\n\n\n\n\nExample:\n\nPositive Prompt: A natural film shot of a charming young woman (25-30 years old) with a youthful face and smooth skin. She wears a gorgeous deep burgundy sequined halter-neck evening gown. Her expression is confident, sexy, and elegant, exuding a sensual aura. The youthful appearance is captured in a lifestyle shot in a high-end hotel, a full-body shot of the model lying in bed, posing boldly. The expression is full of story and atmosphere, the body presents an S-curve, perfectly showcasing the waistline. Aesthetics and Technique: Natural film photography, using 35mm film, Kodak Portra 400, soft flash lighting, slight film grain. Realistic skin texture, visible pores, minor blemishes, unedited. Anti-AI style, snapshot aesthetics, high-fidelity detail. \n\n "
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
