      "widgets_values": [
        "Base models\n\nGGUF: goes to ComfyUI/models/unet folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/jayn7/Z-Image-Turbo-GGUF/tree/main\n\nBF16: goes to ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/diffusion_models\n\nFP8: goes to ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/Kijai/Z-Image_comfy_fp8_scaled/tree/main\n\ntext_encoders: goes to ComfyUI/models/text_encoders folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/text_encoders\n\nfp8\nhttps://huggingface.co/jiangchengchengNLP/qwen3-4b-fp8-scaled/tree/main\n\n\nvae: goes to ComfyUI/models/vae folder\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/tree/main/split_files/vae\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_4b.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── ae.safetensors"
